---
title: "Which agent tasks run unattended, which need a human, which are not agent work"
---
flowchart TD
  A["A task arrives"] --> B{"Reversible, and the data is in hand?"}
  B -- "yes" --> C["Agent runs it unattended"]
  B -- "no" --> D{"Money, approval, or an irreversible action?"}
  D -- "yes" --> E["Agent prepares it, a human approves"]
  D -- "no" --> F{"Needs judgement, law, or a body?"}
  F -- "yes" --> G["Not an agent job"]
  F -- "no" --> H["Agent asks one question, then runs"]
  classDef ok fill:#e8f2ea,stroke:#1a6b2e,color:#14160f
  classDef human fill:#fdf6e6,stroke:#a97b16,color:#14160f
  classDef no fill:#f4f2ee,stroke:#63665e,color:#3f423c
  class C,H ok
  class E human
  class G no
